1
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:09,200
The panel at the bottom shows your trades.

2
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:13,500
Instrument is what you bought or sold.

3
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:17,900
B or S tells you if it was a buy or a sell.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,600
Amount is how much you traded.

5
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:27,500
Open is the price you got in at.

6
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:32,300
P/L is your profit or loss right now.

7
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:38,600
Net P/L is the same but after costs.

8
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:45,500
Pending shows orders waiting to happen.

9
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:53,000
Closed shows trades you have already finished.

10
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:58,100
Open brings you back to your live trades.

11
00:00:58,300 --> 00:01:03,500
Filters let you narrow down what you see.

12
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:09,500
Export CSV saves the list to a file.

